        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Pilots: **Live now** · <a href=\"/traffic\" target=\"_top\">Traffic</a> · <a href=\"/new-pilots\" target=\"_top\">New pilots</a> · <a href=\"/origins\" target=\"_top\">Origins</a> · <a href=\"/pilots\" target=\"_top\">Records</a> · <a href=\"/routes\" target=\"_top\">Routes</a> · <a href=\"/aircraft\" target=\"_top\">Aircraft</a> · <a href=\"/military\" target=\"_top\">Military</a> | ATC: <a href=\"/atc\" target=\"_top\">Overview</a> · <a href=\"/atc-retention\" target=\"_top\">Retention</a> · <a href=\"/atc-hours\" target=\"_top\">Hours</a> · <a href=\"/atc-positions\" target=\"_top\">Positions</a> · <a href=\"/atc-ranks\" target=\"_top\">Ranks</a> | Events: <a href=\"/live-events\" target=\"_top\">Live events</a> · <a href=\"/monday\" target=\"_top\">Monday events</a> | Management: <a href=\"/health\" target=\"_top\">Health</a>\n\nAll times are UTC. Figures cover VATPAC airspace."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pilots in the region now",
      "description": "Pilots connected inside the VATPAC region in the latest network snapshot (v1 card 68, How many pilots online?). The arrow is the change compared with one hour ago.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "vatpac"
      },
      "timeFrom": "1h",
      "hideTimeOverride": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "vatpac"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawSql": "SELECT observed_at AS time, pilots_in_region AS \"Pilots in the region\"\nFROM network_history\nWHERE $__timeFilter(observed_at)\nORDER BY 1",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawQuery": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": false,
        "showPercentChange": true,
        "percentChangeColorMode": "same_as_value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 40
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
